# A unit call of LineRows (81:B38E), which no code refers to: a line from
# ($2C, $2E) to ($30, $32) stepped Bresenham's way, each x stored as a word
# at $7F:5200 + its y. By JSL in a level (stage_a0_s0), DB $80, the
# machine put back after. From (0, 0) to (4, 2): the term starts at 0, so
# the first step moves y (term not negative) and the next keeps it; the
# loop ends past x 4.
load build/aladdin/states/stage_a0_s0.state
wait 2
set 00002C 00,00,00,00
set 000030 04,00,02,00
call 81B38E long p=30 db=80
